den_pie — attribution
======================

This project combines two halves of a field-level forward-modelling +
simulation-based inference (SBI) pipeline for cosmology:

1. PyTorch / sbi inference code
   (den_pie/density, den_pie/spectra, den_pie/util)
   originates from the 21cmPIE-INN line of work; see README.md and setup.py.

2. JAX forward model (den_pie/forward) and Fisher-forecast library
   (den_pie/fisher), together with the Falcon dataset graphs and Fisher run
   configs under config_files/, were ported from:

       joint_fli_sbi — https://github.com/oleg-savchenko/joint_fli_sbi
       (author: Oleg Savchenko and collaborators)

   The code was copied and adapted on 2026-06-30: intra-package imports were
   rewritten for the den_pie package layout (e.g. `from model.model import ...`
   -> `from den_pie.forward.model import ...`), utils.py was relocated to
   den_pie/forward/, and Falcon `_target_` paths were updated from
   `core.model.*` to `den_pie.forward.*`. Scientific behaviour is unchanged.

The upstream joint_fli_sbi repository did not ship an explicit LICENSE file at
the time of porting. If one is added there, that license governs the ported
code in den_pie/forward, den_pie/fisher, and config_files/. Please preserve this
attribution.
